<report>
<title>Dunnett multiple comparisons with a control</title>

<p>Critical value (|d|) = @{d:roundu}<br />
Pooled standard deviation = @{psd:roundu}</p>

<p>Control  <subtotal>(n)</subtotal> = @control  <subtotal>(@cn)</subtotal></p>

<table>
<tr><th>Comparison  <subtotal>(n)</subtotal></th><th>Mean difference <ci>(@pc% CI)</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td>@level  <subtotal>(@cn)</subtotal></td><td>@{delta:roundu}<ci>(@{lci:roundu}  to  @{uci:roundu})</ci></td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr></block>
</table>
</report>
